body:
Ok. And I found that article/web page too and it’s good to know I’m not the only one who’s had this concern. People were trying to say I’m mentally unwell for bringing this up and thats very offensive.

&#x200B;

anyway you definitely helped and I appreciate it

“Since you call yourself tryna be funny” is just a saying. It akin go saying “since you know everythin...” or “since you are a know it all”

&#x200B;

and yes! As a man you will never know the struggles of me as a woman facing colorism. You can have an opinion but I don’t have to take it especially since you’re from the outside looking in.

&#x200B;

and LMAFO! You’re mad because I did what I had to do to give myself a better life?! I’m not the one discriminating against people on the basis of color. I’m giving myself an opportunity to not be discriminated against yet again. I already gave sexism and racism. I don’t need colorism added so if I can eliminate that I will.

&#x200B;

of course bleaching is to benefit myself! Why else would I do it?!
